      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-sans tracking-tight mt-8 mb-4 text-brand-dark dark:text-white">2. Use of Website</h3>
      <p class="text-base md:text-lg">You agree to use this Site for lawful purposes only. You may not use this Site in any way that could damage, disable, or impair its functionality, or interfere with any other party's use of the Site.</p>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-sans tracking-tight mt-8 mb-4 text-brand-dark dark:text-white">3. Intellectual Property</h3>
      <p class="text-base md:text-lg">All content on this Site — including copy, design, graphics, and branding — is the property of Unitscalers unless otherwise stated, and may not be reproduced without written permission.</p>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-sans tracking-tight mt-8 mb-4 text-brand-dark dark:text-white">4. Client Engagements</h3>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mb-6 text-base md:text-lg">
        <li>Any paid engagement is governed by a separate signed service agreement or proposal, which takes precedence over these general Terms in case of conflict.</li>
        <li>Results from marketing services (SEO rankings, ad performance, AI citation) are not guaranteed, as they depend on factors outside our direct control, including platform algorithm changes, market conditions, and client-provided assets.</li>
        <li>Clients are responsible for ensuring all product claims and marketing content comply with applicable advertising and labeling regulations for their industry and jurisdiction.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-sans tracking-tight mt-8 mb-4 text-brand-dark dark:text-white">5. Payment Terms</h3>
      <p class="text-base md:text-lg"><em class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">[Pricing/payment structure to be outlined in individual service agreements]</em></p>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-sans tracking-tight mt-8 mb-4 text-brand-dark dark:text-white">6. Limitation of Liability</h3>
      <p class="text-base md:text-lg">Unitscalers will not be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from the use of our Site or services, to the maximum extent permitted by law.</p>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-sans tracking-tight mt-8 mb-4 text-brand-dark dark:text-white">7. Termination</h3>
      <p class="text-base md:text-lg">Either party may terminate a service engagement per the terms outlined in the specific signed agreement for that engagement.</p>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-sans tracking-tight mt-8 mb-4 text-brand-dark dark:text-white">8. Governing Law</h3>
      <p class="text-base md:text-lg">These Terms are governed by the laws of India, without regard to conflict of law principles.</p>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-sans tracking-tight mt-8 mb-4 text-brand-dark dark:text-white">9. Changes to These Terms</h3>
      <p class="text-base md:text-lg">We may revise these Terms at any time. Continued use of the Site after changes constitutes acceptance of the revised Terms.</p>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-sans tracking-tight mt-8 mb-4 text-brand-dark dark:text-white">10. Contact Us</h3>
      <p class="text-base md:text-lg">Questions about these Terms can be directed to <strong class="text-brand-dark dark:text-white">officia@unitscalers.con</strong>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
